  "description": "Start your BMX journey the right way with the Revo line. Built to deliver an authentic freestyle riding experience, the Revo combines durability, performance, and incredible value in one complete package. Every component has been carefully selected to ensure the bike is ready to shred straight out of the box, easy to maintain, and upgradeable as your skills progress. Loaded with features like 25-9 gearing, tapered fork legs, and short, responsive pro-inspired geometry, the Revo is designed to help riders progress faster and have more fun doing it.\nThe Revo 20\" PRO takes everything riders love about the Revo 20\" and elevates it with a 3-piece crank upgrade for enhanced strength and performance. Designed for progression, it delivers a more dialled ride while maintaining the exceptional value and pro-inspired features of the Revo range.",
